WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Camshaft
What it does: Its lobes determine when and how far the rocker arms and valves move.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Camshaft
How it works: The lobe lifts the rocker arm.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Camshaft
How it moves: Rotates at half crankshaft speed: one camshaft revolution for every two crankshaft revolutions.
